WEBVTT

00:00:01.278 --> 00:00:03.530
Musgrave came back with Captain Cross

00:00:03.530 --> 00:00:05.305
aboard Flying Scud.

00:00:05.305 --> 00:00:06.705
The house only came into view

00:00:06.705 --> 00:00:08.313
when they were about a mile off.

00:00:11.360 --> 00:00:13.638
One man saw the cutter and ran inside

00:00:13.638 --> 00:00:14.938
to tell the other.

00:00:14.938 --> 00:00:16.699
Both came down to the beach.

